463
00:27:54,100 --> 00:27:57,380
If they're not involved, they're all building battle plans of how to get

464
00:27:57,380 --> 00:27:58,300
involved.

465
00:27:58,300 --> 00:28:02,620
Predicting timelines for exchanges is a little bit tougher.

466
00:28:02,620 --> 00:28:06,180
These are large institutions publicly listed.

467
00:28:06,180 --> 00:28:09,300
They don't work week to week, month to month necessarily.

468
00:28:09,300 --> 00:28:13,340
But I think it's fair to say we're going to see traditional exchanges play a role

