00:28:18,380 --> 00:28:19,100
not a few.

472
00:28:19,100 --> 00:28:23,220
But if we expand the timeline to maybe first half of 2026, I think we're going to

473
00:28:23,220 --> 00:28:27,540
see at least half a dozen traditional exchanges enter the space.

474
00:28:27,540 --> 00:28:30,020
That makes a ton of sense and that would be very bullish.

475
00:28:30,020 --> 00:28:34,940
If you look at what this market could be, are there any other regulatory barriers

