00:28:34,940 --> 00:28:37,540
that come to mind that we should be thinking about as an industry?

477
00:28:37,540 --> 00:28:41,460
I mean, one that I think about a lot is just the Basel rules and some of the

478
00:28:41,460 --> 00:28:44,580
constraints that maybe the banks might be under for certain lines of business

479
00:28:44,580 --> 00:28:47,900
outside of custody and plain vanilla trading.

480
00:28:47,900 --> 00:28:52,220
You're hitting on really the most important theme probably, which again, is

