00:36:43,540 --> 00:36:48,140
about in a long time is really what we can call advanced best execution

627
00:36:48,140 --> 00:36:53,020
practices. And what we're doing is we're launching our advanced best bid

628
00:36:53,020 --> 00:36:55,780
offer and our smart order router.

